  "bodyHash": "53e0d92b5eaf4000",
  "content": "\n\n<div>\n  <h1>星輝發光礦石 </h1>\n</div>\n<div>\n  <h1>完全適用於原版 Minecraft </h1>\n</div>\n<p>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/12010f963875d1b43235ff5bccb735c6e22f5814.gif\" alt=\"深板岩鑽石礦石\" width=\"18%\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fc4dd610788d02d8d9bccee0ddcb530d72146aa8.gif\" alt=\"深板岩綠寶石礦石\" width=\"18%\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ec77ae417b5802d9c7f121eff6df942cf174815e.gif\" alt=\"深板岩黃金礦石\" width=\"18%\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d4d2f9498dc10ef1c08ec5d33472775f8fda71da.gif\" alt=\"深板岩青金石礦石\" width=\"18%\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f722318b2b909de158da5fa199d4feb165ff10ea.gif\" alt=\"深板岩紅石礦石\" width=\"18%\">\n</p>\n<p>「星輝發光礦石」為礦石加入星星般的動畫。個別礦石碎片會在不同時間明暗交替，營造出散落閃爍的效果。</p>\n<p>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/01e51f825e9eac0257425379a68a0c38b51a435f.gif\" alt=\"黑暗洞穴中的礦石動畫\">\n</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>無需 OptiFine / Continuity 🚫</li>\n<li>相容 Sodium</li>\n<li>為個別礦石碎片與像素製作動畫</li>\n<li>五種隨機動畫階段</li>\n<li>可透過選配模組調整動畫速度 ⚙️</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>選用模組</h2>\n<p>動畫速度可透過選用模組 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Respackopts</a> 進行調整。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4ea41d8fc7e820cd6c90ff4f6a79951b1c041ad7.jpeg\" alt=\"動畫速度滑桿\"></p>\n<h3>會支援其他模組的礦石嗎？</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>未來更新將計畫支援熱門模組的礦石。</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
